{
  "title": "Ziyarate Imam Zainul Aabedeen (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا سَیِّدَ السَّاجِدِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya sayyida alssajidina\nPeace be upon you, O master of those who prostrate,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا زَیْنَ الْعَابِدِیْنَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya zayna al`abidina\npeace be upon you, O adornment of the worshippers,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا حَلِیْفَ الْحَسَرَاتِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya halifa alhasarati\npeace be upon you, O ally of constant grief,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا ذَالثَّفَنَاتِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya dha alththafanati\npeace be upon you, O possessor of the callosities (from prolonged prostration),\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا صَاحِبَ الْعَبَرَاتِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya sahiba al`abarati\npeace be upon you, O one of ceaseless tears,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَسِیْرَ الْكُرُبَاتِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya asira alkurubati\npeace be upon you, O captive of afflictions,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَاٰدَمَ اٰلِ لْعِبَائِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya adama ali al`aba'i\npeace be upon you, O patriarch of the Family of the Cloak,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ خَامِسِ اَهْلِ الْكِسَائِ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna khamisi ahli alkisa'i\npeace be upon you, O son of the fifth of the People of the Cloak,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَابْنَ سَیِّدِ الشُّهَدَائِ\nalssalamu `alayka yabna sayyidi alshshuhada'i\npeace be upon you, O son of the master of martyrs,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا عِمَادَ الْاَتْقِیَائِ\nalssalamu `alayka ya `imada al-atqiya'i\npeace be upon you, O pillar of the pious,\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ وَرَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ۔\nalssalamu `alayka wa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\npeace be upon you, and Allah’s mercy and blessings."
}
